title: Silvered Both Sides
text: A DUAL REFLECTOR is a mirror with silver on both faces: it turns a beam on either side. Put one where two beams cross and it can turn them both.
trick: dual reflector basics: one mirror turns two beams, one on each face
motif: crossing
expect: merges>=1
